FROM golang:1.25-alpine@sha256:1ae0735f00daffa3aaf1363a5184c0d2dc55c78e3db4ec70241cdac97bf84b59 AS build
ARG GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org,direct
ENV GOPROXY=${GOPROXY}
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod \
    go mod download || \
    (sleep 10 && go mod download) || \
    (sleep 15 && go mod download) || \
    go mod download
COPY . .
ARG TARGETARCH
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux GOARCH=${TARGETARCH:-amd64} \
    go build -ldflags='-w -s' -o /out/sandbox-service ./cmd/sandbox-service

FROM aquasec/trivy:0.72.0@sha256:cffe3f5161a47a6823fbd23d985795b3ed72a4c806da4c4df16266c02accdd6f
COPY --from=build /out/sandbox-service /usr/local/bin/sandbox-service
USER 65532:65532
EXPOSE 8092
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/sandbox-service"]
